<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά-κλῐσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>making</i> one <i>to lie down, seating</i> him <i>at
				table</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπανάστασις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				425b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1165a28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. τοῦ γάμου</span> the
				<i>celebration</i> of the marriage <i>feast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>lying at table, sitting at meat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1336b9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					175e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σχῆμα τῆς κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.679f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>way of lying in bed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κ. ποιείσθω ἐπὶ τὴν ὑγιᾶ γνάθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Prog.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>taking to one's bed</i>, of a sick person, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				4.8.33
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>causing</i> one <i>to take to his bed</i>, i. e. <i>striking
				with disease,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Par.
				1.2496
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>d.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>horoscope cast at the hour when a patient takes to his
			bed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.529
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8(4).57
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
